{"total_count":6,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539/events","html_url":"https://github.com/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539","id":2188499054,"node_id":"I_kwDOA7jats6Ccdhu","number":5539,"title":"Improve UX of street lighting overlay (direct display of options instead of \"select\" button)","user":{"login":"FieteO","id":41323592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzIzNTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41323592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO","html_url":"https://github.com/FieteO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FieteO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2422005771,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDIyMDA1Nzcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"c1fcff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2024-03-15T13:18:34Z","updated_at":"2024-04-29T10:09:50Z","closed_at":"2024-03-15T19:54:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Use case**\r\n<!-- Provide a clear and concise description of *your use case* and what you thus think is missing, and why. -->\r\nWhen answering the street lighting quest, there is currently one dropdown with a proposed lighting type.\r\nIf the currently selected answer is not the right one, two clicks are necessary to change it before clicking okay.\r\n![Screenshot_20240315-131134_Street­Complete](https://github.com/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/assets/41323592/f88ddcc2-08be-40e9-a1a1-4b0f21122f94)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Proposed Solution**\r\n<!-- \r\nThere may be several different solutions for your idea or use case, add your deliberations about it here to help sort out the best one(s).\r\nAdd screenshots or mockups to visualize your idea, if applicable.\r\n-->\r\nThe dropdown could be replaced with the four buttons being directly layed out from left to right (similar to the house level/roof combinations in the house level quest).\r\nThat way, answering would be much easier\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/5539/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/430","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streetcomplete/StreetComplete/issues/430